!Document Status: Working Draft (0.6). See <a href="https://dashif.org/Guidelines/iop-v5/part01-overview.html#document-status">Part 1 §1 Document Status</a> for versioning and workflow.
!Contributors: DASH-IF Technical Working Group. Editors and contributors are maintained via GitHub pull requests to the IOPv5 repository.
!Key Words: Conformance, Reference Tools, Validator, dash.js, livesim2, Test Assets
